# prettier formats only the files listed after "!*/" below: the page's scripts (shell/), its input modules (input/),
# the gateway Worker and eslint's configuration. Everything else is upstream's, or the lab's, and keeps its own style.
# That includes the JavaScript emcc links into plClient.js (--js-library and --pre-js files): Emscripten's
# preprocessor reads those files ({{{ }}} macros and #if lines), and prettier can change what it makes of them (it
# drops the ';' after a {{{ }}} macro, for one). The page itself, shell/index.html, stays out too: prettier re-wraps
# long text in every whitespace mode, which renders the same but changes the text nodes the page and its tests read
# (textContent).
*
!*/
!/eslint.config.mjs
!/Sources/Plasma/Apps/plClient/emscripten/shell/boot.mjs
!/Sources/Plasma/Apps/plClient/emscripten/shell/config.mjs
!/Sources/Plasma/Apps/plClient/emscripten/input/*.mjs
!/web/deploy/worker/src/*.js
